/datapin
.env
coverage/

# Generated by datapin itself: the rendered docs site (`datapin site build`,
# deployed as an orphan gh-pages commit) and the man page (`make man`). The
# SOURCES are docs/*.md plus the [site] section of .datapin/datapin.toml.
/public/
/man/

# Serena MCP local project cache
.serena/

# Agent-local state, not project source: skill installs (npx skills add),
# agent worktrees, and scheduler locks. The skill SOURCE of truth is
# skills/datapin/SKILL.md, guarded by cmd/skill_doc_test.go — installed
# copies must never be committed or they become a second, untested copy.
.agents/
.claude/skills/
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
skills-lock.json
